<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P01"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P01 — Keep one cumulative application and the existing preview</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P02"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P02 — Benchmark populated 30–50-layer artist workflows before expanding capacity</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P03"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P03 — Separate document operations from rendering before replacing rendering internals</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P04"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P04 — Use sparse raster tiles, bounded residency/cache and changed-region undo</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P05"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P05 — Investigate GPU compositing with fallback</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P06"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P06 — Preserve editable layers, folders, masks and clipping sources</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P07"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P07 — Bring image references and clothing patterns alongside image import/clipping</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P08"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P08 — Introduce cached image tips/grain and bounded splatter/sprinkle before sophisticated wet-media simulation</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P09"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P09 — Investigate proprietary brush import using representative files and an explicit supported-setting subset</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P10"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P10 — Core artist workflow: sketch → outline → flats → shadows clipped to folders → group levels/HSL/curves → text</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P12"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P12 — Magic wand and precision selection (magnetic selection and editable pen/path tool) move ahead of bucket, gap-aware and lasso/enclosure fill</data></node>
<node id="urn:unruly:decision:D-P11"><data key="type">Decision</data><data key="name">D-P11 — Keep a short current checkpoint brief and append consequential decisions</data></node>
